DESCRIPTION:Formed by members of Amsterdam’s famed Royal Concertgebouw O
 rchestra (RCO)\, Camerata RCO performs chamber music in multiple formation
 s from duet to small chamber orchestra\, with a special focus on the Class
 ical and Romantic repertoire for winds and strings\, and active relationsh
 ips with living composers. Praised by the NewYorkTimes for their “warm\,
  glowing performance\,” the ensemble has enjoyed success in the Netherla
 nds and abroad and performs nearly 50 concerts a season internationally.\n
